killed the whole turn with the 'disabled native tool' error. The turn
now retries inside the same OpenCode session (--session) with a
corrective prompt restating the <pi_tool_call> marker contract, up to
OPENCODE_PI_TOOL_RESCUES attempts (default 2; 0 restores fail-fast).

